cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use the records, the benchmark or the stored results, please cite the paper below."
type: dataset
title: "Reproducibility package of From Contribution to Clause: Source-Bound Traceability Records and a Chain-Question Benchmark for the 3GPP Standardization Process"
abstract: >-
  Source-bound traceability records of the five 3GPP Radio Access Network
  working groups in JSON-LD and SQLite, the OWL ontology and SHACL shapes
  they instantiate, a benchmark of 667 chain questions in seven families
  with its build gate, the stored responses and scores of every evaluated
  condition, the per-item diagnosis of agent misses, and the scripts that
  produced them. The package refers to 3GPP documents by identifier,
  archive path, SHA-256 and locator, and a restore script fetches the cited
  meeting reports from the public 3GPP archive.
